Model weights (not redistributed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Decis does not redistribute model weights. Images built from this repository
download weights at build time from their upstream publishers. Users are
responsible for complying with each model's license:

  convaiinnovations/laya                Apache-2.0
      One repository holding three checkpoints. Decis registers them under three
      engine ids, all served from this single repo at a pinned revision:
        laya                  the repository root
        laya-multilingual     the `multilingual/` subfolder
        laya-typed-decisions  the `typed-decisions/` subfolder
      `decis download` fetches only the files of the checkpoint you asked for.

  jaredpalmer/kev-*                     Apache-2.0
  Qwen/Qwen3.5-*-Base                   Apache-2.0

  mstrasser/Jeff-Qwen3.5-0.8B           Apache-2.0
      A full fine-tune of Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B (Apache-2.0) with its own readout head.
      `jeff`, `jeff-qwen` and `jeff-qwen3.5` resolve to this checkpoint.

  mstrasser/Jeff-Gemma4-E2B             Apache-2.0, plus Google's Gemma 4 terms
      A full fine-tune of google/gemma-4-E2B-it, which is the reason for the second
      half: the Hub card declares `license: apache-2.0` and links
      https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license for the base model's own
      terms. Read both before redistributing this checkpoint.

  Note that the code and the weights of the jeff project are licensed separately:
  the source vendored above is MIT, while both checkpoints are Apache-2.0.

